   "summary": {
    "value": {
     "zh-Hant": "1926年7月就任國民革命軍總司令並發動北伐，1928年底就任國民政府主席。1948年4月由第一屆國民大會選為行憲後首任總統，1975年4月5日病逝臺北。",
     "en": "He became Commander-in-Chief of the National Revolutionary Army in July 1926 and launched the Northern Expedition, and became Chairman of the National Government at the end of 1928. In April 1948 the First National Assembly elected him the first President under the Constitution; he died in Taipei on 5 April 1975."
